---
import Demo from '../layouts/Demo.astro';
import meta from '../demos/voice-turn/meta';
import Island from '../demos/voice-turn/Demo.tsx';
---
<Demo meta={meta}>
  <Island client:only="react" />
  <div slot="notes">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>The model identifies intent as transcript fragments arrive. Local rules check that required details are present before responding. While a reply is playing, a separate check detects an interruption.</p>
    <h3>Demo scope</h3>
    <p>The microphone and speech are simulated with a scripted transcript. Nothing is recorded; only transcript text is sent. Intent confidence describes the model’s judgment, not certainty that a request is complete.</p>
  </div>
</Demo>
